id: pm-receipt-native-fixture
title: "GH-1612: canonicalize native receipt fault fixtures and guard macOS before merge"
description: "Scheduled main77ff26ad Nightly40482594067 macOS Node24 shard2/2 fails five receipt-index-snapshot fault cases at their initial positive authority assertion: zero indexed blobs instead of one. A controlled symlink TMPDIR replay on unchanged0af source independently reproduces the same five AssertionErrors with no suite/runtime errors. Production snapshot transfer already passes the canonical physical source directory; the new fault fixture passes the lexical alias to a reader whose linked-directory argument is an index coordinate. Canonicalize the owned fixture root and add the existing complete receipt snapshot suite to the existing native macOS merge check, preserving all fault assertions and production boundaries."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags[3]: github,nightly,portability
