author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 90
acceptance_criteria: "Controlled aliased TMPDIR replay fails with exactly the five initial positive authority assertions before the fixture correction and passes after; no production containment or read-error semantics, budgets, retries or assertions are weakened; native macOS pre-merge verification and required exact coverage pass before closure."
value: Catch native filesystem fixture regressions before merge and retain authority fault coverage
impact: Receipt snapshot test portability and native macOS admission
parent: pm-ycyymg
risk: low
confidence: high
resolution: "Canonicalized owned fixture roots before deriving Git index coordinates and added the complete receipt snapshot suite to the existing macOS merge smoke. Production containment, authority assertions and deadlines remain intact."
expected_result: "All five source-failure scenarios start from positive indexed authority, preserve exact snapshot index bytes and execute on native macOS before merge."
actual_result: Pinned unsafe source reproduces all five intended assertion failures with no setup errors. Current four-file linked receipt suite passes. Native macOS job122381186744 independently passes all8snapshot cases on1c534fce727cf29d22cc44c20db570d41a357712; containing cohort21tests and follow-up271tests pass. All required hosted coverage/static/platform gates pass; local11512 tests have exact100% coverage.
