    text: "text=Duplicate check: complete3139-item all-status corpus, request-specific receipt snapshot source-index alias searches and fresh context/open/in_progress inventories; full live closed source-receipt owner and recurrence measurement owner plus open reliability-lineage item inspected. The older macOS alert1544 concerns repaired cache-exclusion rules and is not this five-case receipt setup failure. Reuse completed source authority lineage through this bounded native fixture child. Report1612: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1612 ; failed native job https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/actions/runs/40482594067/job/122116361740 . No product defect or historical-rate repair is claimed."
