    text: "Controlled reproduction and correction: unchanged0af0391c1c4a4c2ff80a2e0abb74379b3bcb3169 under an external symlink-addressed TMPDIR fails exactly all five initial source-index authority assertions (expected1, actual0), with empty Vitest suite-error messages. Canonicalizing only the owned fault-fixture root makes the same five cases pass; all31 connected receipt tests and the linked execution pass. The complete8-case snapshot suite is added to the existing native macOS merge step, retaining job names, timeouts, all assertions, source index byte preservation, containment and production error behavior. Typecheck, focused ESLint, diff checks and read-only workflow permissions pass. The item remains actively claimed until native macOS and exact source coverage acceptance complete. The portable pinned counterexample was independently executed and proved all five named failures; an earlier replay setup correctly refused a TMPDIR inside its disposable checkout and is not counted as regression evidence."
