    text: "Final local acceptance on c646aef86a1a8cd3ae28786def648fccfc15355a: Node24.21 full canonical run passes876 test files and11509 tests with3 legitimate platform skips. Exact coverage passes71103/71103 statements,54739/54739 branches,14625/14625 functions and67254/67254 lines, zero uncovered counts. Existing five-case aliased TMPDIR red/green, pinned unsafe-source control,31 connected/linked tests, typecheck, lint and workflow permissions remain verified. Hosted source admission is unavailable: after the bounded20-minute watcher, all9 emitted Actions jobs are still QUEUED, including the build foundation, so the native macOS step has not executed. The exact-commit analyzer gate separately refuses missing DeepScan. GitHub public status shows operational and does not establish a queue cause. The preceding0af full review finished with zero new findings; the c646 full request is rate limited until approximately11:24UTC. No remote job cancellation, threshold change or approval bypass was used. Preserve explicit native/hosted acceptance as unmet; return this implemented repair to open/unclaimed pending external execution rather than falsely close it."
